      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹应该看过很多历史书。\n还是先接受她的好意，\n问她有什么推荐的书吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc58643414ca8030d257af9cf06a79a637a4fc3ea91c28227680ae86ef9ab35a",
